 "description": "AUTHORITATIVE detail for one Kalshi market by ticker (e.g. \"KXFED-26OCT-T3.50\"), live OR long-settled \u2014 Kalshi drops older markets from its live endpoints (they 404 there), and this falls through to Kalshi's historical archive and says which answered in `source`. Returns the rules text (so you know exactly what the market settles on \u2014 critical before quoting odds), yes_ask + no_ask prices in cents, last_price, volume, open_interest, expiration date, settlement criteria. Use after kalshi_events / kalshi_event to drill into a specific market, or when you already have a Kalshi ticker. For depth-of-book use kalshi_orderbook.",
 "inputSchema": {
  "examples": [
   {
    "ticker": "KXFED-26OCT-T3.50"
   },
   {
    "ticker": "PRES-2024-DJT"
   }
  ],
  "properties": {
